## Summary

Part of #63 (Hunter). Bird house trapping on Fossil Island was not implemented.

Depends: `content/hunter-module` (the Hunter module skeleton PR; this branch carries that commit and goes in after it merges, rebased then).

- The four bird house spaces are multilocs on varps 1626-1629 (the values RuneLite's Time Tracking reads): build (or use a bird house on the space), then add seeds: 10 low-level seeds, or 5 wildblood hop or ranarr-and-higher herb seeds (mixing allowed).
- After 50 minutes, Empty or Reset gives the clockwork, 10 raw bird meat (always dropped to the ground), 30-60 feathers, nests and the Hunter XP, with the collect message RuneLite's Loot Tracker parses.
- The seed nest chance is the skilling formula over the wiki chart (1/256 at level 1, 101/256 at 50, 201/256 at 99), then five rolls on the nest table.
- Emptying a house early asks first, then keeps the clockwork and loses the house, seeds and loot.
- Reset places a new house one tick later: a carried bird house first, otherwise one built from logs and the clockwork with a hammer and chisel (the bird house's Crafting level and XP).
- Data: tier data in the server-only dbtable `birdhouse_types` (56003, rows 60163-60171; logs and Crafting level/XP columns for Reset), server varps 63762-63769, own `BirdHousePluginPack`. The ids are assigned by `tools/scripts/fix_gameval_conflicts.py` above the OSRS maximum per table, names prefixed `birdhouse_`. `::birdhouses` makes seeded houses full (testing).

