## How it was tested

- `BirdHouseScriptTest` (new, `content:skills:hunter` integration, 11 tests): the collect message matches what the Loot Tracker parses; each space is the multiloc of its transmit varp; nine tiers in order, regular first; nest chances follow the wiki's chart; every roll at zero gives a seed nest and five ring nests; build, seed, wait and empty (the raw bird meat on the ground); the seed nest follows the wiki chart; five high-level seeds fill a house, and seeds mix; emptying early keeps only the clockwork; Reset builds a new house from logs and the clockwork (an oak house at Crafting 20); a full inventory drops the loot instead of losing it.
- Fork CI (GitHub Actions: freshCache, buildCache, assemble test integration, boot) green at the commit.
- Not checked in game on this commit (the integration tests cover the flow); the upstream gate's in-game re-check is still to come.

